WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.910
You read «un roman».

2
00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:04.760
A romance? Then «une nouvelle».

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:08.730
Something new? Now write
about a whole story in French.

4
00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.150
One hour. No dictionary.

5
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.310
Where do you start?

6
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:13.410
The first page?

7
00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.710
The ending? Your opinion?

8
00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:19.240
So how do you write in French
about a story you've studied,

9
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.480
with no dictionary to help?

10
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.910
In this mission, you'll meet «Léa»,

11
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.910
the heroine of «Le Carnet bleu»,

12
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.640
a story made up for this lesson.

13
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.910
Then you'll put your summary on a train,

14
00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.130
with two tense tracks ahead.

15
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.410
Your mission: build a memory kit,

16
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.640
and write about your story from memory.
